<page-meta
  page-style="{{pageMetaStyle}}"
  background-color="{{mbPageBg}}"
  background-color-top="{{mbNavBg}}"
  background-color-bottom="{{mbPageBg}}"
  root-background-color="{{mbPageBg}}"
/>
<mb-bottom-safe />
<view class="mb-page mb-theme-{{mbTheme}}" style="{{pageShellStyle}}">
  <view class="mb-page-chrome" style="{{pageBgStyle}}"></view>
  <view class="mb-page-bg" style="{{pageBgStyle}}"></view>
  <view class="mb-page-body about-page">
  <view class="about-hero">
    <image class="about-logo" src="/static/mine.png" mode="aspectFit"/>
    <text class="about-name">眠音盒</text>
    <text class="about-slogan">AI 为你定制专属白噪音</text>
  </view>

  <view class="about-card">
    <text class="about-lead">
      我们专注于将脑波频率、自然声景与疗愈器乐结合，帮助你在睡前放松、入睡更深。你可以在创作流程中选择乐器、脑波与节拍，叠加白噪音与人声，生成属于自己的睡眠配乐。
    </text>
  </view>

  <view class="about-card">
    <text class="section-title">产品亮点</text>
    <view class="feature-list">
      <view class="feature-item" wx:for="{{features}}" wx:key="title">
        <text class="feature-title">{{item.title}}</text>
        <text class="feature-desc">{{item.desc}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="about-card muted">
    <text class="legal-line">使用本小程序即表示你理解音乐内容为辅助放松用途，如有长期睡眠障碍请咨询专业医疗机构。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="about-footer">
    <text class="version-text">版本 {{version}} · {{envLabel}}</text>
    <text class="copyright">© 眠音盒</text>
  </view>
  </view>
</view>
